      "traditional": "小明媽媽：你說，我們家誰是一家之主？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma nǐ shuō wǒ men jiā shéi shì yì jiā zhī zhǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: Tell me, who is the head of our family?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明爸爸：是你！",
      "traditional": "小明爸爸：是你！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà ba shì nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: It’s you!"
    },
    {
